Path(".github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/feature_request.yml").write_text("""name: Feature request\ndescription: Suggest a Detour improvement\ntitle: \"[Feature] \"\nlabels: [enhancement]\nbody:\n  - type: textarea\n    id: problem\n    attributes:\n      label: Problem\n      description: What user problem should Detour solve?\n    validations:\n      required: true\n  - type: textarea\n    id: proposal\n    attributes:\n      label: Proposed behavior\n    validations:\n      required: true\n  - type: textarea\n    id: alternatives\n    attributes:\n      label: Alternatives / notes\n""")
Path(".github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md").write_text("""## Summary\n\n- \n\n## Verification\n\n- [ ] Unit tests / relevant tests added or updated\n- [ ] Lint/build passes\n- [ ] No real VPN credentials, invitation links, private keys or keystores included\n- [ ] Documentation updated when behavior/security/import formats changed\n- [ ] UI changes reuse shared Detour components and were checked in light/dark themes\n\n## User-visible impact\n\nDescribe what changes for users and any migration/compatibility considerations.\n""")
